sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Merchant
  participant Mini as Miniapp
  participant Auth as AuthMiddleware
  participant C as CreationService
  participant AI as AiService
  participant G as AiGateway
  participant B as BeanService
  participant R as RenderService
  participant W as RenderWorker
  participant P as PremiumService
  participant O as OrderService
  participant WX as WeChat Pay
  participant DB as MySQL

  M->>Mini: Login / submit request
  Mini->>Auth: Authorization Bearer access token
  Auth->>Auth: verifyToken(secret)
  Auth->>DB: (recommended) verify Merchant ACTIVE
  Auth-->>Mini: merchant context or 401

  M->>Mini: Create creation(storeId,dishId)
  Mini->>C: createCreation(merchantId,input)
  C->>DB: verify Store merchant ownership
  C->>DB: create Creation
  DB-->>C: Creation
  C-->>Mini: creation

  M->>Mini: Generate copy/storyboard(requestId)
  Mini->>C: generateCopy/generateShots(...)
  C->>DB: require subscription + getCreation tenant scoped
  C->>AI: runBilledScene(params)
  AI->>DB: lock BeanAccount + FREEZE ledger(requestId)
  AI->>G: runScene(scene, variables)
  G->>DB: select provider/model; write AiCallLog
  G-->>AI: text, cost, fallback
  alt AI failed or timeout
    AI->>DB: UNFREEZE ledger
    AI-->>C: fallback template + zero charge
  else AI success
    AI->>DB: CONSUME actual charge; release remainder
    AI-->>C: text + balance snapshot
    C->>DB: update copy or replace Shots
  end
  C-->>Mini: result + code/message/data/traceId

  M->>Mini: Submit render(requestId)
  Mini->>R: submitRender(merchantId,creationId,input)
  R->>DB: lock Creation; check active RenderTask
  R->>DB: create RenderTask QUEUED or MANUAL_PENDING
  R->>DB: lock BeanAccount + FREEZE ledger
  alt Demo mode
    R->>DB: CONSUME ledger + mark RenderTask SUCCESS
    R-->>Mini: successful task/result key
  else Machine render
    R-->>Mini: QUEUED task
    W->>DB: conditional QUEUED -> RUNNING claim
    W->>DB: read clips and COS metadata
    W->>W: FFmpeg normalize/concat/TTS/subtitle
    W->>DB: transaction completeRender + CONSUME
    W-->>Mini: polling shows SUCCESS
  else Premium render
    R-->>Mini: MANUAL_PENDING task
    P->>DB: conditional claim MANUAL_PENDING -> MANUAL_DOING
    P->>DB: transaction completeRender + CONSUME
    P-->>Mini: polling/re-entry shows SUCCESS
  end
  alt Render failure or SLA timeout
    W->>DB: transaction UNFREEZE
    W->>DB: mark RenderTask FAILED
    P->>DB: transaction UNFREEZE
    P->>DB: mark RenderTask FAILED/SLA_TIMEOUT
  end

  M->>Mini: Buy membership/bean package
  Mini->>O: createMemberOrder/createBeanOrder
  O->>DB: create Order PENDING with immutable amount
  alt Real payment
    O->>WX: JSAPI order
    WX-->>O: prepay_id
    O-->>Mini: wx.requestPayment params
    WX->>O: POST encrypted notify(raw body)
    O->>O: verify signature, timestamp, decrypt AES-GCM
    O->>DB: conditionally mark PAID by orderNo/transactionId
    O->>DB: recharge or activate Membership + grant ledger
  else Demo payment disabled only in non-production
    O->>DB: markOrderPaid with DEV transaction
  end
  O-->>Mini: order status / refreshed balance
